  "notes": "Conducted 62 WebSearch queries targeting World Gospel Mission missionaries and staff. Direct page fetching was blocked as expected; relied entirely on search result snippets and summaries to mine names, roles, locations. Found 35 new missionaries/staff not in the known list of 59. Geographic coverage: Kenya (8 people), Paraguay (6), Bolivia (4), Mexico (2), Japan (2), Hungary (3), Albania (3), Argentina (2), South Sudan (2), Scotland (2), USA regional/mid-term (4), plus headquarters leadership (2). Tier A (missionaries with fit scores 7-10) dominated; Tier B (HQ leadership with fit scores 4-7) included Tim Rickel (VP International Ministries) and Benji Jenkins (Regional Director Asia Pacific). Key findings: Billy and Joanna Coppedge confirmed in Scotland on Special Assignment for oral Scripture engagement; Kevin and Moselle Stark in Kenya leading medical team building at Tenwek Hospital; specialized ministries identified across regions (Faith Aid in Kenya, Morning Star Ranch in Hungary, Diaspora Ministry in Argentina). Coverage maps all suggested query patterns including country-specific searches, leadership titles, and staff directories. No evidence of deceased people; all listed are current/active."
